# test: config_split
# description: A split-config installation starts, exposes profiles, stops and restarts

## Environment

config:
  name: local
  host_name: split-device

terminal:
  name: T1
  config: local

## Test

@T1
> amux init
> amux server stop
Server shutting down.

> amux server start
Server started.

> amux profiles
Profiles:
  cd45a091-bfc8-505c-984c-25c3df220ee6  local    unbound / local

> amux list
No agents running.

> amux server stop
Server shutting down.

> amux server start
Server started.

> amux server stop
Server shutting down.
